  "90 min of scheduled Zone 2 and about 26 min of vigorous work a week. Some muscle soreness is expected; joint pain is not. Still sore after 48 hours? Repeat sessions before moving up.": "90 min van geskeduleerde Sone 2 en ongeveer 26 min van kragtige werk per week. Sommige spierpyn word verwag; gewrigspyn is nie. Nog steeds seer na 48 uur? Herhaal sessies voordat jy opbeweeg.",
