  "Activity groups This week, History and Progress into one navigation item with three tabs.": "Aktiwiteit groepe Hierdie week, Geskiedenis en Vordering in een navigasie-item met drie oortjies.",
  "Activity keeps all four tabs on one line and stacks the three weekly progress charts.": "Aktiwiteit hou al vier oortjies op een lyn en stapel die drie weeklikse vorderingskaarte.",
  "Activity views": "Aktiwiteitsbeskouings",
  "Add activity": "Voeg aktiwiteit by",
  "Add equipment": "Voeg toerusting by",
  "Add or edit your equipment during setup or in Settings under Your equipment. These home exercises stand in for Bryan's gym exercises.": "Voeg jou toerusting by of wysig dit tydens opstelling of in Instellings onder Jou toerusting. Hierdie tuisoefeninge staan ​​in vir Bryan se gimnasium-oefeninge.",
  "Add set": "Voeg stel by",
  "Add set is a labelled button at the end of the last set row. Set cards stay narrow and extra sets scroll inside their box.": "Voeg stel by is 'n benoemde knoppie aan die einde van die laaste stel ry. Stel kaarte bly smal en ekstra stelle blaai binne hul boks.",
  "Add set stays at the end of the last set row, and the timer and remove buttons line up across every row.": "Voeg stel blyplekke by aan die einde van die laaste stel ry, en die timer en verwyder knoppies in lyn oor elke ry.",
  "Add weight only when you hit the top of the rep range on every set with clean form, two sessions in a row: about +{kg:1-2} per dumbbell for upper body, +{kg:2-4} for legs. Bryan’s protocol stresses progressive overload: increase the load gradually.": "Voeg slegs gewig by wanneer jy die bopunt van die rep-reeks op elke stel met skoon vorm slaan, twee sessies in 'n ry: ongeveer +{kg:1-2} per halter vir bolyf, +{kg:2-4} vir bene. Bryan se protokol beklemtoon progressiewe oorlading: verhoog die las geleidelik.",
  "Add weight only when you hit the top of the rep range on every set with clean form, two sessions in a row: about +0.5–1 kg per dumbbell for upper body, +1–2.5 kg for legs. Bryan’s protocol stresses progressive overload: increase the load gradually.": "Voeg gewig by net wanneer jy die bopunt van die rep-reeks op elke stel met skoon vorm slaan, twee sessies in 'n ry: ongeveer +0.5–1 kg per halter vir bolyf, +1–2.5 kg vir bene. Bryan se protokol beklemtoon progressiewe oorlading: verhoog die las geleidelik.",
  "Add your equipment names and product links, or skip this step and do it later in Settings. The animations show how the plan uses each accessory.": "Voeg jou toerustingname en produkskakels by, of slaan hierdie stap oor en doen dit later in Instellings. Die animasies wys hoe die plan elke bykomstigheid gebruik.",
  "Add your own equipment below.": "Voeg jou eie toerusting hieronder by.",
  "Add-on": "Byvoeging",
  "Add-on done": "Byvoeging klaar",
  "Add-on repeat and Sunday controls sit on one compact line in Settings.": "Byvoegingsherhaling en Sondagkontroles sit op een kompakte lyn in Instellings.",
  "Add-on repeats appear on their exact cycle days again; every 3 days no longer shows the add-on daily.": "Byvoegingsherhalings verskyn weer op hul presiese siklusdae; elke 3 dae wys nie meer daagliks die byvoeging nie.",
  "Add-on repeats now count from the last completed or skipped day and stay available until done, instead of appearing only on exact cycle days.": "Byvoegingsherhalings tel nou vanaf die laaste voltooide of oorgeslaande dag en bly beskikbaar totdat dit klaar is, in plaas daarvan om net op presiese siklusdae te verskyn.",
  "Add-ons": "Byvoegings",
  "Added": "Bygevoeg",
  "addon-sunday:": "addon-sondag:",
