  "Animation styles (a test): nine ways to draw the exercise animation, for now only on Zone 2 (\"Easy step-ups or marching\"); every other exercise keeps the mannequin. Mannequin, Athlete (semi-realistic), Anime (cel-shaded), Low poly, Cartoon (ink outlines) and Voxel are three.js scenes; Pictogram (SVG), Ink brush (2D canvas) and ASCII (text) are drawn without three.js. All of them play the same movement.": "Animasiestyle ('n toets): nege maniere om die oefening-animasie te teken, vir eers net op Sone 2 (\"Maklike stap-ups of marsjeer\"); elke ander oefening hou die mannequin. Mannequin, Atleet (semi-realisties), Anime (cel-shaded), Low poly, Cartoon (ink buitelyne) en Voxel is three.js tonele; Piktogram (SVG), Ink-kwas (2D-doek) en ASCII (teks) word sonder drie.js geteken. Almal van hulle speel dieselfde beweging.",
