  "At easier levels, move slowly until you learn the movement.": "Op makliker vlakke, beweeg stadig totdat jy die beweging leer.",
  "At least 120 min of scheduled Zone 2 and about 51 min of hard cardio a week; controlled vigorous blocks on Tuesday, Thursday and Saturday.": "Ten minste 120 minute se geskeduleerde Sone 2 en ongeveer 51 minute harde kardio per week; beheerde sterk blokke op Dinsdag, Donderdag en Saterdag.",
  "At New to training and Returning, keep the pace brisk and below all-out effort. At Active, work hard. At Well trained, use all-out effort.": "At New to training and Returning, hou die pas vinnig en onder alle moeite. At Active, werk hard. At Well trained, gebruik alle moeite.",
  "At Returning and above, hold a dumbbell in each hand, or loop a band around your waist with its anchor in front of you. The band should pull you forward, like a sled.": "At Returning and above, hou 'n halter in elke hand, of lus 'n band om jou middel met sy anker voor jou. Die band moet jou vorentoe trek, soos 'n slee.",
  "At Returning, push back up with your hands. At higher levels, pull yourself back with your hamstrings.": "At Returning, druk terug met jou hande. At higher levels, trek jouself terug met jou dyspiere.",
  "At the end of your last interval, note your peak heart rate. Walk gently for 60 seconds and note your heart rate again. Enter the drop (peak minus 60s reading).": "Aan die einde van jou laaste interval, let op jou piek hartklop. Loop saggies vir 60 sekondes en let weer op jou hartklop. Voer die daling in (piek minus 60s lesing).",
