  "Athlete is now the default style and comes first; Mannequin is number 2. If you already picked a style, you keep it. Every exercise without styles still shows the mannequin.": "Atleet is nou die verstekstyl en kom eerste; Mannequin is nommer 2. As jy reeds 'n styl gekies het, behou jy dit. Elke oefening sonder style wys steeds die mannequin.",
