  "Bryan 2026: jumps for fast-twitch power": "Bryan 2026: spring vir vinnige krag",
  "Bryan adds a weighted vest during Zone 2 walks and hikes to increase axial bone loading safely.": "Bryan voeg 'n geweegde baadjie by tydens Sone 2-staptogte om die aksiale beenlading veilig te verhoog.",
  "Bryan calls the phone the worst trigger for bad posture. Hold it at eye level and put the top of your monitor at eye level too.": "Bryan noem die foon die ergste sneller vir slegte postuur. Hou dit op ooghoogte en sit die bokant van jou monitor ook op ooghoogte.",
  "Bryan calls this technical and was taught it for his own diagnosed condition. Stay gentle, and stop if you get dizziness, tingling or a headache.": "Bryan noem dit tegnies en is dit vir sy eie gediagnoseerde toestand geleer. Bly sag en stop as jy duiseligheid, tinteling of hoofpyn kry.",
  "Bryan demo with timestamp": "Bryan demo met tydstempel",
  "Bryan demonstrates it at {time} ({clock})": "Bryan demonstreer dit by {time} ({clock})",
  "Bryan did 1 × 10 in 2023. His 2025 Galpin session includes Nordic curls in the strength block. They protect against hamstring strains.": "Bryan het 1 × 10 in 2023 gedoen. Sy 2025 Galpin-sessie sluit Nordiese krulle in die sterkteblok in. Hulle beskerm teen dyspiere.",
  "Bryan does “butterfly pulls” with a resistance band, 1 × 15. Most write-ups describe it as a band chest fly; watch his clip to copy his exact version.": "Bryan doen \"vlindertrekke\" met 'n weerstandsband, 1 × 15. Die meeste opskrywings beskryf dit as 'n bandborsvlieg; kyk na sy snit om sy presiese weergawe te kopieer.",
  "Bryan does 3 × 10 per leg, learned from Ben Patrick, the Knees-Over-Toes coach working with him on his 2026 dunk project. It builds the inner quad (VMO) and knee resilience.": "Bryan doen 3 × 10 per been, verneem van Ben Patrick, die Knie-oor-Toe-afrigter wat saam met hom aan sy 2026 dunk-projek werk. Dit bou die binneste quad (VMO) en knieveerkragtigheid.",
  "Bryan does both grips": "Bryan doen albei grepe",
  "Bryan does both. His 2025 Galpin session includes them in the strength block at 2 × 5–8. His official beginner list uses assisted pull-ups.": "Bryan doen albei. Sy 2025 Galpin-sessie sluit hulle in die sterkteblok by 2 × 5–8 in. Sy amptelike beginnerslys gebruik geassisteerde optrekke.",
  "Bryan does the Pallof press in his 2025 session with Dr. Andy Galpin. It trains the trunk to resist twisting.": "Bryan doen die Pallof-pers in sy 2025-sessie met dr. Andy Galpin. Dit lei die stam om draai te weerstaan.",
  "Bryan does tibialis raises (1 × 25, single-leg in his list). His 2026 dunk notes mention limited ankle dorsiflexion. This exercise works on that movement.": "Bryan doen tibialis-verhogings (1 × 25, enkelbeen in sy lys). Sy 2026 dunk notas noem beperkte enkel dorsale fleksie. Hierdie oefening werk op daardie beweging.",
  "Bryan has been training to dunk at 49 since July 2026, using heavy lifts with jumps between sets. He says he needs more fast-twitch fibres and faster force development, and warns about Achilles risk from landing forces. Learn to land before working on height.": "Bryan oefen sedert Julie 2026 om op 49 te dunk, met swaar hysbakke met spronge tussen stelle. Hy sê hy benodig meer vinnige vesels en vinniger kragontwikkeling, en waarsku oor Achilles-risiko van landingsmagte. Leer om te land voordat jy op hoogte werk.",
