  "Bryan Johnson's zero-blood, at-home physical testing battery. Track your functional biomarkers against elite 18-year-old and longevity longevity percentiles.": "Bryan Johnson se nul-bloed, tuis fisiese toetsbattery. Volg jou funksionele biomerkers teen elite 18-jarige en langlewendheid-persentiele.",
  "Bryan measures grip strength as a primary longevity biomarker (scoring ~60 kg, top 5% of all ages). Hanging decompresses the spine and builds forearm grip endurance.": "Bryan meet greepsterkte as 'n primêre langlewendheid-biomerker (met ~60 kg, top 5% van alle ouderdomme). Hangende dekomprimeer die ruggraat en bou uithouvermoë van die onderarmgreep.",
  "Bryan on X: 10 squats every 45 minutes of sitting": "Bryan op X: 10 hurke elke 45 minute van sit",
  "Bryan on X: a jump in between sets": "Bryan op X: 'n sprong tussen stelle",
