  "Bryan on X: the two posture exercises, with clips": "Bryan op X: die twee postuur oefeninge, met clips",
  "Bryan on X: training to dunk, heavy pull": "Bryan op X: opleiding om te dunk, swaar trek",
  "Bryan opens his workouts with a backward sled drag (about 2 min in his 2023 routine, still first in his 2025 warm-up with Dr. Andy Galpin). It works the knees and quads using the Knees-Over-Toes approach.": "Bryan open sy oefensessies met 'n terugwaartse sleesleur (ongeveer 2 min in sy 2023-roetine, steeds eerste in sy 2025-opwarming met Dr. Andy Galpin). Dit werk die knieë en quads deur die Knie-oor-Toe-benadering te gebruik.",
  "Bryan puts injury prevention first. If a joint hurts, open the exercise and switch to its easier version.": "Bryan stel beseringsvoorkoming eerste. As 'n gewrig seer maak, maak die oefening oop en skakel oor na die makliker weergawe daarvan.",
  "Bryan shared this tip in April 2026 for days spent sitting. In the study he cited, squat breaks improved blood sugar more than one 30-minute walk. He stressed taking breaks from sitting.": "Bryan het hierdie wenk in April 2026 gedeel vir dae wat hy sit. In die studie wat hy aangehaal het, het hurkpouses bloedsuiker verbeter met meer as een stap van 30 minute. Hy het beklemtoon om pouses van sit te neem.",
  "Bryan spends weekends hiking, biking, climbing or playing pickleball at an easy pace. Your indoor session combines controlled vigorous cardio at your level, a long Zone 2 block and 20 min of stretching. This is the second posture strength day.": "Bryan spandeer naweke om teen 'n maklike pas te stap, fietsry, te klim of pickleball te speel. Jou binnenshuise sessie kombineer beheerde sterk kardio op jou vlak, 'n lang Sone 2-blok en 20 minute se strek. Dit is die tweede postuurkragdag.",
  "Bryan targets at least 75 min of high-intensity cardio a week, with only about 10 min near maximum effort. This home block supplies controlled vigorous minutes alongside his Tuesday bursts and Thursday 4×4; its duration is set for this home plan and differs from the sessions in his sample week.": "Bryan teiken ten minste 75 minute hoë-intensiteit kardio per week, met slegs sowat 10 minute naby maksimum inspanning. Hierdie tuisblok verskaf beheerde kragtige minute langs sy Dinsdag-sarsies en Donderdag 4×4; die duur daarvan is vir hierdie huisplan vasgestel en verskil van die sessies in sy voorbeeldweek.",
  "Bryan tests ~60 kg (top 5% across all ages). Handgrip strength is a primary biological age biomarker in clinical longevity literature.": "Bryan toets ~60 kg (top 5% oor alle ouderdomme). Handgreepsterkte is 'n primêre biologiese ouderdombiomerker in kliniese langlewendheidsliteratuur.",
  "Bryan tests at ~64 ml/kg/min (top 1% 18yo). Cardiovascular fitness is the single strongest statistical predictor of longevity.": "Bryan toets teen ~64 ml/kg/min (top 1% 18 jaar). Kardiovaskulêre fiksheid is die enkele sterkste statistiese voorspeller van langlewendheid.",
  "Bryan trains obliques for 1 × 25: on the hyperextension bench in 2023, as oblique side bends in his 2025 conditioning block.": "Bryan oefen skuins vir 1 × 25: op die hiperekstensiebank in 2023, soos skuins sybuigings in sy 2025-kondisioneringsblok.",
