  "Bryan: 60+ strict continuous reps (chest to floor, zero top pauses). Harvard study: 40+ push-ups correlated with 96% lower cardiovascular events.": "Bryan: 60+ streng deurlopende herhalings (bors tot vloer, nul top pouses). Harvard-studie: 40+ opstote het gekorreleer met 96% laer kardiovaskulêre gebeure.",
  "Bryan: 75": "Bryan: 75",
