  "Grip the bar slightly wider than shoulder-width and let your body hang without swinging.": "Gryp die staaf effens wyer as skouerwydte vas en laat jou lyf hang sonder om te swaai.",
  "Grip the bar with two hands, feet off the floor. Breathe steadily and hold as long as possible until grip gives out.": "Gryp die staaf met twee hande vas, voete van die vloer af. Asem bestendig en hou so lank as moontlik totdat die greep weggee.",
