  "Gudrun": "Gudrun",
  "Guided exercise doses, set announcements, form cues during rest and spoken interval, hold and cardio timers.": "Begeleide oefendosisse, stel aankondigings, vorm leidrade tydens rus en gesproke interval, hou- en kardio-timers.",
  "Guided intervals show every round in order beneath the demonstration, including recovery breaks.": "Begeleide intervalle wys elke rondte in volgorde onder die demonstrasie, insluitend herstelpouses.",
  "Guided navigation leaves completion unchanged; the progress bar reflects completed steps only.": "Begeleide navigasie laat voltooiing onveranderd; die vorderingsbalk weerspieël slegs voltooide stappe.",
  "Guided timed exercises now open with the timer already running in the right panel; Pause, Next and Stop sit beside it, and the old timer button is only a restart.": "Begeleide tydoefeninge is nou oop met die timer wat reeds in die regte paneel loop; Pouse, Volgende en Stop sit langsaan, en die ou timer-knoppie is slegs 'n herbegin.",
  "Guided timed exercises show a compact Start timer card instead of starting on their own. Only one timer sits in the right panel, and stopping or logging it brings the Start card back for the next set.": "Begeleide tydoefeninge wys 'n kompakte Begin-timerkaart in plaas daarvan om op hul eie te begin. Slegs een timer sit in die regterpaneel, en as u dit stop of aanteken, bring u die Start-kaart terug vir die volgende stel.",
  "Guided timers run in the same row as the value, in place of the timer button, and no longer push the form down.": "Begeleide tydtellers loop in dieselfde ry as die waarde, in die plek van die tydtellerknoppie, en druk nie meer die vorm af nie.",
  "Guided timers start from the timer button beside each editable value instead of a separate Start card. They still never start by themselves.": "Begeleide tydtellers begin vanaf die timerknoppie langs elke bewerkbare waarde in plaas van 'n aparte Begin-kaart. Hulle begin nog nooit vanself nie.",
  "Guided workout": "Begeleide oefensessie",
  "Guided workouts": "Begeleide oefensessies",
  "Guided workouts fill each exercise with your level's reps, seconds, minutes or rounds, so Done, next records the plan even when you leave the fields alone.": "Begeleide oefensessies vul elke oefening met jou vlak se herhalings, sekondes, minute of rondtes, so Klaar, teken volgende die plan aan selfs wanneer jy die velde alleen verlaat.",
  "Guided workouts group repeated interval movements so long routines fit on screen.": "Begeleide oefensessies groepeer herhaalde intervalbewegings sodat lang roetines op die skerm pas.",
  "Guided workouts no longer error if the last step is clicked again.": "Begeleide oefensessies fouteer nie meer as die laaste stap weer geklik word nie.",
  "Guided workouts now keep the session blocks together. A small group name under the top progress bar and in the step list shows where you are, and add-ons use their own colour.": "Begeleide oefensessies hou nou die sessieblokke bymekaar. 'n Klein groepnaam onder die boonste vorderingsbalk en in die staplys wys waar jy is, en byvoegings gebruik hul eie kleur.",
