  "Keep a wall within reach at first; the animation shows the hands-free version.": "Hou eers 'n muur binne bereik; die animasie wys die handvrye weergawe.",
  "Keep adding weight using the rules below. After illness, injury or a long break, step down a level for a while.": "Hou aan om gewig by te voeg deur die reëls hieronder te gebruik. Na siekte, besering of 'n lang pouse, trap 'n vlak vir 'n rukkie af.",
  "Keep both heels down and lift both sets of toes.": "Hou albei hakke af en lig albei stelle tone op.",
  "Keep each bounce quick, quiet and springy. Build height later.": "Hou elke weiering vinnig, stil en veerkragtig. Bou hoogte later.",
  "Keep going: {count} more {sessions}{weeks} to the checkpoint. Tick the checks when they are true.": "Gaan voort: {count} meer {sessions}{weeks} na die kontrolepunt. Merk die tjeks wanneer dit waar is.",
  "Keep going: 18 more sessions (about 3 weeks) to the checkpoint. Tick the checks when they are true.": "Gaan voort: nog 18 sessies (sowat 3 weke) na die kontrolepunt. Merk die tjeks wanneer dit waar is.",
  "Keep knees unlocked: soft knees allow the bone to absorb osteogenic impact without straining the joint cartilage.": "Hou knieë oop: sagte knieë laat die been osteogene impak absorbeer sonder om die gewrigskraakbeen te verrek.",
  "Keep the back leg long to stretch the hip flexor.": "Hou die agterbeen lank om die heupbuiger te strek.",
  "Keep the effort controlled. Save near-max efforts for the short bursts and the ends of the 4×4 rounds.": "Hou die moeite beheer. Bespaar amper maksimum pogings vir die kort sarsies en die eindes van die 4×4 rondtes.",
  "Keep the effort gentle and focus on form before adding weight. Chin tucks and the doorway stretch are standard exercises outside Bryan's routine.": "Hou die moeite sag en fokus op vorm voordat jy gewig byvoeg. Kinstukkies en die deuropeningstrek is standaardoefeninge buite Bryan se roetine.",
  "Keep the knees bent so they travel forward over the toes, and push the floor away in front of you.": "Hou die knieë gebuig sodat hulle vorentoe oor die tone beweeg, en druk die vloer voor jou weg.",
  "Keep the other leg long and both feet on the floor.": "Hou die ander been lank en albei voete op die vloer.",
  "Keep the route clear and turn before reaching the wall.": "Hou die roete skoon en draai voor jy die muur bereik.",
  "Keep the selected exercise animation visible when switching between Course and other themes.": "Hou die geselekteerde oefenanimasie sigbaar wanneer daar tussen Kursus en ander temas gewissel word.",
  "Keep this movement selected": "Hou hierdie beweging gekies",
  "Keep your body straight from knees to head and squeeze your glutes.": "Hou jou liggaam reguit van knieë tot kop en druk jou glutes.",
  "Keep your landings light and quiet. Follow the pace prescribed for this step.": "Hou jou landings lig en stil. Volg die tempo wat vir hierdie stap voorgeskryf is.",
  "Keep your neck long and look forward and down.": "Hou jou nek lank en kyk vorentoe en af.",
  "Keep your ribs down without arching your lower back. Stop if you feel pinching in the shoulder.": "Hou jou ribbes af sonder om jou onderrug te buig. Stop as jy voel dat jy in die skouer knyp.",
