  "Place a hand on your forehead and resist gentle backward pressure without moving your head.": "Plaas 'n hand op jou voorkop en weerstaan ​​sagte terugwaartse druk sonder om jou kop te beweeg.",
  "place your hands on the mat. Use it for planks, floor work and stretches too.": "plaas jou hande op die mat. Gebruik dit ook vir planke, vloerwerk en strekwerk.",
  "Place your whole foot on the step. Push through that leg until you stand tall.": "Plaas jou hele voet op die trappie. Druk deur daardie been totdat jy hoog staan.",
  "Plan": "Plan",
  "Plan and track six home workouts a week based on Bryan Johnson's public exercise protocol. You'll do strength training three days a week, plus short intervals, the Norwegian 4×4, Zone 2, balance and mobility. The workouts use bodyweight, adjustable dumbbells, a pull-up bar and bands.": "Beplan en volg ses tuisoefeninge per week op grond van Bryan Johnson se openbare oefenprotokol. Jy sal drie dae per week kragoefening doen, plus kort intervalle, die Noorse 4×4, Sone 2, balans en mobiliteit. Die oefensessies gebruik liggaamsgewig, verstelbare handgewigte, 'n optrekstaaf en bande.",
  "Plan change history now lives in Settings instead of the Plan page.": "Planveranderingsgeskiedenis is nou in Instellings in plaas van die Plan-bladsy.",
  "Plan change:": "Planverandering:",
  "Plan change: A new, gentler set of workouts for New to training: supported or smaller-range moves, 1 to 2 sets, no jumps, swings or Nordics, shorter intervals and Zone 2.": "Beplanverandering: 'n Nuwe, sagter stel oefensessies vir Nuut in opleiding: ondersteunde bewegings of bewegings met 'n kleiner reeks, 1 tot 2 stelle, geen spronge, swaaie of Nordics, korter intervalle en Sone 2.",
  "Plan change: Added two optional Blueprint micro-routine add-ons in Settings: Bone density protocol (heel drops & stomp drills, pogo hops, and landing drills from Bryan's bone health guide) and Dead hang & grip (passive and active bar hangs and farmer's holds for spinal decompression and grip longevity).": "Planverandering: Twee opsionele Bloudruk-mikro-roetine-byvoegings in Instellings bygevoeg: Beendigtheidsprotokol (hakval- en stampbore, pogo-hop en landingsoefeninge van Bryan se beengesondheidsgids) en Dooie hang en greep (passiewe en aktiewe staafhange en boer se houe vir ruggraat-dekompressie en greep-langlewendheid).",
  "Plan change: Changing your training level in Settings now switches you to that level's workouts: weights rescale and your phase restarts from the level's starting point.": "Planverandering: As jy jou oefenvlak in Instellings verander, word jy nou na daardie vlak se oefensessies oorgeskakel: gewigte herskaal en jou fase herbegin vanaf die vlak se beginpunt.",
  "Plan change: Clarified the setup notes for ATG split squats, single-leg toe touches, band pull-aparts, standing external rotation, side planks and side-to-side leg swings.": "Planverandering: Verduidelik die opstellingsnotas vir ATG gesplete hurk, enkelbeen-toonaanrakings, band-uitmekaartrek, staande eksterne rotasie, syplanke en kant-tot-kant beenswaaie.",
  "Plan change: Combined warm-ups and exercise variations now appear as separate movements. Guided pairs alternate one set at a time, keeping the existing doses.": "Planverandering: Gekombineerde opwarmings- en oefenvariasies verskyn nou as afsonderlike bewegings. Begeleide pare wissel een stel op 'n slag af en behou die bestaande dosisse.",
  "Plan change: Phases (Re-entry, Build, Blueprint), their automatic advance after 12 and 24 sessions, the phase lock and the starting-phase setting.": "Planverandering: Fases (Hertoetreding, Bou, Bloudruk), hul outomatiese vordering na 12 en 24 sessies, die faseslot en die beginfase-instelling.",
  "Plan change: Scheduled Zone 2 and controlled vigorous cardio scale by level toward Bryan’s weekly targets of 150 minutes of Zone 2 and 75 minutes of hard cardio.": "Planverandering: Geskeduleerde Sone 2 en beheerde kragtige kardio-skaal volgens vlak na Bryan se weeklikse teikens van 150 minute van Sone 2 en 75 minute van harde kardio.",
  "Plan change: Setup no longer asks you to pick a starting phase: your training level decides it. \"Well trained\" now starts in Blueprint (was Build).": "Planverandering: Opstelling vra jou nie meer om 'n beginfase te kies nie: jou opleidingsvlak bepaal dit. \"Goed opgelei\" begin nou in Blueprint (was Bou).",
  "Plan change: Side-to-side leg swings say \"Stand tall with one hand on the wall\" (the animation stands square, not side-on).": "Planverandering: Beenswaaie van kant tot kant sê \"Staan regop met een hand teen die muur\" (die animasie staan ​​vierkantig, nie aan die kant nie).",
  "Plan change: Single-leg balance and the forehead-resistance hold no longer state a fixed time or count that differs from your level; their animation cues now point to the time or holds your level prescribes.": "Planverandering: Enkelbeenbalans en die voorkop-weerstand hou nie meer 'n vaste tyd of telling wat verskil van jou vlak nie; hul animasie leidrade wys nou na die tyd of hou jou vlak voorskryf.",
  "Plan change: Step-ups use a low aerobic step; Poliquin heel taps start on a slant board on the floor, with matching animations.": "Planverandering: Stap-ups gebruik 'n lae aërobiese trap; Poliquin-hakkrane begin op 'n skuins bord op die vloer, met bypassende animasies.",
  "Plan change: Well trained includes all target cardio without extra walks; keeping the strength work makes sessions 72 to 93 minutes.": "Planverandering: Goed opgelei sluit alle teikenkardio in sonder ekstra staptogte; hou die krag werk maak sessies 72 tot 93 minute.",
  "Plan change: Your training level alone now sets the workouts. Each of the four levels (New to training, Returning, Active, Well trained) has its own sets, reps, intervals and Zone 2 minutes; nothing moves on by itself. Your weight, sex and age still scale the suggested weights.": "Beplan verandering: Jou oefenvlak alleen bepaal nou die oefensessies. Elk van die vier vlakke (nuut by opleiding, Terugkeer, Aktief, Goed opgelei) het sy eie stelle, herhalings, intervalle en Sone 2 minute; niks beweeg vanself aan nie. Jou gewig, geslag en ouderdom skaal steeds die voorgestelde gewigte.",
