  "Thread the needle": "Ryg die naald",
  "Three demonstration videos for every exercise: two technique videos and one short, focused clip. When Bryan has a video it still opens first and stays the default.": "Drie demonstrasievideo's vir elke oefening: twee tegniekvideo's en een kort, gefokusde snit. Wanneer Bryan 'n video het, maak dit steeds eerste oop en bly die verstek.",
  "Thu": "Do",
  "Thursday": "Donderdag",
  "Thursday in Bryan’s newest weekly template (exercise newsletter, 4 Oct 2026): 4 rounds of 4 min at 85–95% of max heart rate with 3 min at 60–70% between, at a hard, controlled pace below an all-out sprint, starting with 2–3 rounds if four is too much. Bryan’s own variant (X, Dec 2024) is 4 min all-out with 4 min rest.": "Donderdag in Bryan se nuutste weeklikse sjabloon (oefennuusbrief, 4 Okt 2026): 4 rondtes van 4 minute teen 85–95% van maksimum hartklop met 3 minute teen 60–70% tussen, teen 'n harde, beheerde tempo onder 'n algehele naelloop, begin met 2–3 rondtes as vier te veel is. Bryan se eie variant (X, Des 2024) is 4 min voluit met 4 min rus.",
  "Thursday, October 1": "Donderdag, 1 Oktober",
