  "To switch to active hang, pull your shoulder blades down and slightly back away from your ears without bending your elbows.": "Om oor te skakel na aktiewe hang, trek jou skouerblaaie af en effens terug weg van jou ore sonder om jou elmboë te buig.",
  "Today": "Vandag",
