  "Today uses the same inline timer instead of opening a separate timer window. The Timer button beside Minutes and intervals is a little larger.": "Vandag gebruik dieselfde inlyn timer in plaas daarvan om 'n aparte timervenster oop te maak. Die Timer-knoppie langs Minute en intervalle is 'n bietjie groter.",
  "Today, This week, the guided workout, Progress, the exercise pages and The plan show your level instead of a phase; The plan and each exercise compare all four levels.": "Vandag, Hierdie week wys die begeleide oefensessie, Vordering, die oefenbladsye en Die plan jou vlak in plaas van 'n fase; Die plan en elke oefening vergelyk al vier vlakke.",
