  "Tuesday": "Dinsdag",
  "Tuesday in Bryan’s newest weekly template (exercise newsletter, 4 Oct 2026): 8 rounds of 20 s efforts with 40 s rest for beginners, then moderate cardio. Day 2 of his official protocol uses 20 s all-out with 20 s rest. These bursts are where most of your near-max minutes come from.": "Dinsdag in Bryan se nuutste weeklikse sjabloon (oefennuusbrief, 4 Okt 2026): 8 rondtes van 20 s pogings met 40 s rus vir beginners, dan matige kardio. Dag 2 van sy amptelike protokol gebruik 20 s all-out met 20 s rus. Hierdie sarsies is waar die meeste van jou byna maksimum minute vandaan kom.",
