  "Tuesday: 8 × 20 s hard. Thursday: 3 rounds of 4 min, then 4.": "Dinsdag: 8 × 20 s hard. Donderdag: 3 rondtes van 4 min, dan 4.",
  "Tuesday: brisk 20 s bursts with long recoveries. Thursday: 2 controlled rounds of 3 min, building to 3 rounds.": "Dinsdag: flink 20 s bars met lang herstel. Donderdag: 2 beheerde rondtes van 3 min, bou aan na 3 rondtes.",
  "Tuesday: Intervals 1 · 20-second bursts + Zone 2 + back & core": "Dinsdag: Intervalle 1 · 20-sekonde-sarsies + Sone 2 + rug en kern",
  "Tuesday: two blocks of 8 × 20 s all-out. Thursday: the full Norwegian 4×4 at {hr:85-95}.": "Dinsdag: twee blokke van 8 × 20 s all-out. Donderdag: die volle Noorse 4×4 by {hr:85-95}.",
  "Tuesday: two blocks of 8 × 20 s all-out. Thursday: the full Norwegian 4×4 at 159–178 bpm.": "Dinsdag: twee blokke van 8 × 20 s all-out. Donderdag: die volle Noorse 4×4 teen 159–178 bpm.",
