  "Well trained contrast: 20–30 s after each set, do 3 max countermovement jumps, the way Bryan pairs his heavy pulls with jumps.": "Goed geoefende kontras: 20–30 s na elke stel, doen 3 maksimum teenbewegingspronge, soos Bryan sy swaar trekke met spronge koppel.",
